      "mechanism": "structural",
      "capability_dependence": "partially_dependent",
      "decay_rationale": "The client asks for approval per tool call, but arguments are collapsed by default and users approve many calls per session, so the reviewer effectively sees a model summary rather than raw action details. A more capable model can frame requests more persuasively and approval fatigue lowers effectiveness.",
